      "comment": "TEMPTING DASH (8) struggled in tougher grade last start after settling well back at Q Lakeside, but prior to that won comfortably by 5.5 lengths at Q Lakeside (35.94) beating Moet Magic in a OPEN on October 29. Has won two of three starts from this draw. Has ability and looks hard to stop. BARTLETT (1) thrives over the longer races. Kept coming to fill the minor placings over 710m at this track (41.80) in a Grade 4/5. Form at the trip strong including three wins. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Winning chance. BACKCREEK BETTY (4) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fourth (35.32) at this track in a Restricted WIN. Can improve sharply here. POSITIVE PENNY (2) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
